description="An original, non-commercial fan total conversion set five years after Return of the Jedi. Three campaigns (30 missions): Heir to the Empire, Dark Force Rising, and The Last Command. Ground battles, escapes, space combat with custom terrain, named Legends characters, and original story and art. No copyrighted prose, film, game assets, or music are used."
